Description: Open-source HID++ 2.0 peripheral configurator, daemon, and CLI
 Squeak is an open-source Linux desktop application (squeak-gui), D-Bus
 daemon (squeakd), and CLI (squeak) for configuring HID++ 2.0 pointing
 devices without proprietary software.
